Servo
Wega embeds the Servo web engine (https://servo.org/), used under MPL-2.0.
The vendor/ directory of the source repository contains modified copies of
the Servo 0.7.0 crate (MPL-2.0) and the epaint 0.37.0 crate (MIT OR
Apache-2.0). Each modified file is marked, and vendor/README.md describes the
changes. Licenses of all other third-party components are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.html, distributed with every binary.

